flowchart TB
  U[Student Browser] -->|HTTPS| CF[CloudFront + private S3 frontend]
  U -->|sign-up / sign-in| COG[Amazon Cognito]
  U -->|JWT| APIGW[API Gateway HTTP API<br/>JWT authorizer + throttling]
  APIGW --> DOC[Lambda: documents]
  APIGW --> ASK[Lambda: ask]
  APIGW --> WS[Lambda: workspace<br/>chats / feedback / stats]
  APIGW --> STUDY[Lambda: study API]
  DOC -->|presigned POST / GET| S3[(S3 documents<br/>uploads/ + vectors/)]
  U -->|direct upload| S3
  S3 -->|ObjectCreated| PROC[Lambda: process-document]
  PROC -->|scanned PDF| TX[Amazon Textract OCR]
  PROC -->|embeddings| BR[Amazon Bedrock<br/>Titan V2 + Claude]
  PROC --> S3
  PROC --> DDB[(DynamoDB documents)]
  ASK --> BR
  ASK --> S3
  ASK --> ACT[(DynamoDB activity<br/>single-table)]
  STUDY -->|async invoke| WORK[Lambda: study-worker]
  WORK --> BR
  WORK --> S3
  WORK --> ACT
  WS --> ACT
  CW[CloudWatch dashboard + alarms + X-Ray] -.-> ASK
  CW -.-> PROC
